<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{!submitted}}" class="card"><text class="title">申请加入部门</text><text class="muted">微信手机号未唯一匹配人员档案。请补充本人姓名和部门，管理员审核并关联已有档案后才能进入培训。</text><form bindsubmit="submit"><text class="label">姓名</text><input class="field" name="name" placeholder="请输入真实姓名"/><text class="label">申请部门</text><picker range="{{departments}}" range-key="name" bindchange="chooseDepartment"><view class="field">{{departmentIndex >= 0 ? departments[departmentIndex].name : '请选择部门'}}</view></picker><text class="label">说明</text><textarea class="field" name="reason" placeholder="例如：档案手机号已变更"/><button class="primary" form-type="submit" loading="{{busy}}">提交部门加入申请</button></form><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text></view><view wx:else class="card"><text class="title">申请已提交</text><text class="muted">管理员审核并关联档案后即可进入培训任务。审核前不会自动获得已登记人员身份。</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="back">重新登录查看状态</button></view></view>
